WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.850
The gate is a fake?

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.750
It's an excellent copy, on the surface.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.140
It's enitrely different inside.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:11.960
So someone created it to lure Playmaker?

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.890
I think I know who.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:14.860
Who?

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.200
Don't do anything for now.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:21.930
Your brother should know it's fake too.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:25.600
Blood Shepherd?

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.540
Yeah.  I saw him inside the gate.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.910
So the counting guy created 
this gate as a trap.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:37.780
Sorry.  If I only noticed sooner...

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:41.750
Kusanagi, let's focus on saving Soulburner.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.840
Can you open the gate?

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:48.860
It doesn't look easy.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.520
Only you can do it, Kusanagi.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:54.230
Okay.  I'll do my best.

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.470
Hey, Playmaker.  They're here.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.980
Kusanagi, bounty hunters are here!

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:07.640
Why now!

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:09.340
I'll draw their attention.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.250
The rest's up to you!

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:38.860
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:45.670
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:52.950
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:59.520
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:06.290
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:13.530
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:20.210
I want to share your pain

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:52.920
He's not the prey I wanted 
to catch.  But it's fine.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.250
He has an Ignis too.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.720
Show it to me, Soulburner.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:06.640
Soulburner...

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:08.930
Takeru...

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.340
Takeru!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.670
You're finally awake.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.400
You didn't come to school again.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.810
What's the point?

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:24.360
You're going to be expelled.

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:26.940
I don't care.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:31.320
The school brought your grandpa in.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.060
Grandpa?

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:37.240
Don't make him worry.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:52.810
Takeru?

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.060
Hand it over.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:04.060
I don't have any money.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:07.930
You shouldn't disobey my big bro.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.740
Don't lie, or you'll pay!

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:14.220
Hey.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.940
You have a problem?

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.480
Pretending to be a hero?

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:37.160
I'm against violence!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.900
Big bro, just beat him up!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:45.860
That look...  He's dangerous.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.270
Thank you!

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:54.740
Umm...

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.920
Sorry, but he's not friendly.

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:04.950
Takeru...

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.540
What's wrong?

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.580
Something there?

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:16.520
Did you hear a voice?

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.700
Voice?  No.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:20.800
What is it?

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:25.540
It's too bright out for ghosts to appear.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:26.900
Stop it.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:29.410
I know you're afraid of ghosts.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.410
Don't be mad.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:35.380
I'm home.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.320
Welcome home.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:42.420
Change and go to the dojo.  His orders.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.590
Not good enough!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:50.200
You don't want to go to school?  That's fine.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:55.570
But as a man, is that the right decision?

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:59.440
Do you truly believe that's fine?

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.580
Not good enough.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:22.860
Do you truly believe that's fine?

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:27.470
Look, I know!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:34.040
It's because of what happened ten years ago.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:38.540
The past is the past.  He must overcome it.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.280
He's actually a bright boy.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:46.250
He could've thrown me, but he hesitated.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:49.150
Because Takeru is nice.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:11.840
Your Mom and Dad searched for you everyday.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.440
And...

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:18.140
And they were in an accident.

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:24.340
Takeru...

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.460
LINK VRAINS...

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.330
Playmaker...

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:36.800
It said...

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:42.140
Link...  Brain...

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:44.210
Playmater...

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:52.550
Playmaker is trending in LINK VRAINS again.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:56.090
He defeated the Knights of Hanoi?

00:07:56.370 --> 00:08:00.930
He always steals the spotlight.  So annoying!

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:01.600
Hey!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.200
What's LINK VRAINS?

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:08.930
I'm against violence!

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:12.040
What's Playmater?  Tell me!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.480
It's Playmaker.

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:18.340
LINK VRAINS is a virtual 
space popular in Den City.

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:22.650
Playmaker is the duelist 
who saved LINK VRAINS.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:24.200
Duelist?

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.550
Duel...

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.350
Ryu!

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:29.090
Ryu!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.820
Are you okay, Ryu?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.480
Big bro!  I was scared!

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.800
Little bro!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.000
How dare that Homura!

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:47.740
I'll teach him a lesson.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.000
Duel...

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.880
Yes...  That's a plan.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:02.850
Here.  LINK VRAINS's hero, Playmaker.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:08.030
Kiku...

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:11.540
How do I read what's next?

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:14.800
You're really bad at this.

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:16.030
Here.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.740
Knights of Hanoi...  Hunt Playmaker...

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:24.080
Go Onizuka...  Blue Angel...

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.680
Hello, Hana.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:28.280
Uh huh...

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.840
Playmaker...

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:35.420
Ten years ago...  Takeru's past...

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:36.940
Duel...

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:43.710
What are you doing?  This is expensive!

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.330
Months of part-time jobs!

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:49.240
I-It spoke!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.800
Maybe you turned on the volume.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.410
Nothing's here.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.680
Playmaker...  My past...

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.460
What's the connection?

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:30.840
You finally held the Disk, Takeru Homura.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.250
Now we can talk-

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:38.620
Calm down, Takeru Homura!

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:43.860
You're the ghost Grandpa talked about!

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.440
You possessed a Disk!

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:47.480
Calm down, Takeru Homura!

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:50.060
I'm not a ghost.  I'm an AI.

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:57.540
Takeru Homura!  Your past 
is connected to Playmaker!

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:02.880
And it'll clear the way to your future.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.370
Lost Incident...

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.480
Playmaker's a victim, like me.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:13.520
That's right.  He was also there.

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.460
I don't want to remember that incident.

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:21.060
But not Playmaker.  He's facing his past.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:26.860
And Playmaker's Ignis is my comrade.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.800
By the way, Takeru Homura...

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:30.060
What is it?

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:34.410
Can you let me out?  Let's talk eye-to-eye.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:36.370
Just an eye is scary.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.700
Then...

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:41.450
Sorry!  Just an eye is fine!  Go back!

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:44.350
You're exasperating.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:50.150
If you meet Playmaker, 
you may find your path.

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:55.960
Right now, you're struggling to find 
that path.  How you ought to be.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.430
Don't you want to change?

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.580
Let's go to Den City together.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:05.800
To meet Playmaker, I have 
to go to LINK VRAINS?

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:06.980
Yes.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:10.440
So I may have to duel?

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.510
Likely so.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:26.890
I decided I wouldn't duel anymore.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:30.760
Takeru Homura, what you need is my-

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.230
Takeru, is someone there?

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.620
No.  What is it?

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:39.070
Your friend from class is here.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.710
Mizunuma has Kiku?

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:45.580
They took her!  They're 
telling you to come alone.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.210
That punk...

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:51.150
Wait!  They had another message.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.960
Give me back my cell phone!

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:05.160
I will when Homura gets here.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:07.100
Let Kiku go!

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:10.600
Takeru!

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:13.970
I came alone, like you said.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:15.840
And the Duel Disk?

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.280
I knew it.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:27.320
Since you were interested in Playmaker, 
I thought you'd duel.  Bingo.

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.550
What do you want?

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.290
Duel my little bro.

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:36.860
Duel?

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:40.720
If my little bro wins, you'll be our minion.

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.140
If I win?

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:44.800
I won't bother you again.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:47.410
Takeru!  Don't let him provoke you!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:54.050
Takeru Homura, this fight 
will decide your future.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.680
It has an AI.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:10.330
Will you turn tail and run?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:11.800
Don't run.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:15.570
If you want to change, face your destiny.

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:21.470
Let Kiku go!

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:22.660
Here.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:24.940
Takeru!

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:30.240
Hana is waiting behind me.  Go home.

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:31.360
But...

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.600
Go home.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:53.370
My little bro made the 
national duel tournament.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.570
I'm known as Mad Marsh!

00:14:55.570 --> 00:15:00.240
Aka the dragon god of the bottomless 
swamp, Ryujiro Mizunuma!

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:03.150
He definitely made that up just now.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:05.620
It's a stylish name.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.950
Takeru Homura, what do people call you?

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.950
I don't know.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.340
Duel!

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:24.140
I'll go first.  My turn!

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:28.670
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Call of the Mummy!

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.580
When there are no monsters on my field...

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:37.010
...once per turn, I can Special 
Summon a Zombie-Type from my hand!

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:39.750
I Special Summon Plague Wolf!

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:48.830
I summon another Plague Wolf from my hand!

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:55.570
I activate each Plague Wolf's effect!

00:15:56.050 --> 00:16:00.270
Once per turn, their ATK are doubled.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:05.010
When this effect is used, they're 
destroyed at the end of the turn.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:08.370
You probably know this, but 
he can't battle this turn.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:12.500
Since the two cards used their effects, 
they'll be destroyed at the end of the turn.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:16.080
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.190
However...

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:21.460
The two Plague Wolves are now destroyed.

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:25.430
Why'd he do something pointless?

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:28.900
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, 
Surrounded by Fallen Wolves!

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:38.000
When an effect destroys two or three copies 
of a Zombie with 1000 or lower ATK this turn...

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:41.900
...I can Special Summon them in defense 
position without their effects!

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:44.620
Come, two Plague Wolves!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:50.250
He resurrected the two that were destroyed.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:55.860
And I draw a card for every monster 
Special Summoned by this effect.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:17:00.170
His goal was to strengthen his 
defense and increase his hand.

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:01.880
That's solid dueling.

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:04.370
Takeru Homura, what will you do?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.740
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:12.080
I activate the spell card, Majesty of Fire!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.980
When there are no monsters on my field...

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:19.820
...I can Special Summon a Level 5 
or higher Fire monster from my hand.

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:23.250
I Special Summon Phoenix Gearfried!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:33.560
Already a monster with 2800 ATK.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.200
Not bad.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:40.300
I equip the Equip Spell, Phoenix 
Gearblade, on Phoenix Gearfried!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:45.080
It increases the equipped 
monster's ATK by 300!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:49.880
Then I summon Valkyrian Knight!

00:17:55.060 --> 00:18:01.590
When it's on the field, you can't attack 
Warriors other than Valkyrian Knight!

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:04.200
You've gathered a bunch of riffraff.

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:08.670
Battle!  Valkyrian Knight 
attacks Plague Wolf!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.570
You think you'll attack me first?

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.400
Don't be so arrogant!

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:19.680
I'll battle again!

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:23.980
Phoenix Gearfried attacks Plague Wolf!

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.720
Hey!  He destroyed both instantly!

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:35.090
But my LP wasn't hurt at all.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:38.060
Phoenix Gearblade's effect activates!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:42.030
When the equipped monster destroys 
your monster in battle...

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:44.740
...I can send this card to the graveyard!

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:50.880
Now my Fire Warriors can 
attack twice this turn!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:53.780
Ryu!  He's attacking two more times!

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.350
If he succeeds, you'll lose!

00:18:56.350 --> 00:19:00.450
That's right.  It seems 
your swamp was shallow.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.820
I'm against violence!

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:06.420
It's not violence.  It's a battle!

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:08.690
Valkyrian Knight attacks you directly!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.960
Big bro!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.500
Little bro!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.840
Just kidding.

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:20.240
I activate the trap card, 
Howl of the Fallen Wolf!

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:24.710
It activates when your 
monster attacks me directly.

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:30.810
I Special Summon two copies of a Zombie 
with 1000 or lower ATK in defense position!

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.950
C'mon, Plague Wolves!

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:40.890
Then I add a Field Spell 
in my deck to my hand.

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.630
I add Edge of Darkness to my hand!

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:47.360
Pummel 'em, Valkyrian Knight!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.770
Phoenix Gearfried!

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:02.310
Every time they're summoned, 
they're destroyed.  How sad.

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:05.680
Too bad.  I took no damage.

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:07.940
I end my turn.

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:10.520
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:13.620
I activate the Field Spell, Edge of Darkness!

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:25.370
What's this?

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.270
Scared?

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:33.110
Once per turn, I banish two copies 
of a Zombie from my graveyard...

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:37.950
...to add a Zombie in my 
graveyard or deck to my hand!

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:41.450
I banish two Plague Wolves from my graveyard!

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:47.420
Pay attention to my special combo!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.790
He's annoying.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.260
I activate the Continuous Spell, 
Call of the Mummy's effect!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:57.130
Once per turn, when there are 
no monsters on my field...

00:20:57.130 --> 00:21:01.240
...I can Special Summon 
a Zombie from my hand!

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:04.840
I Special Summon Despair from the Dark!

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:08.610
What's wrong, Takeru Homura?

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:28.910
No...

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.660
No...  No...

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:39.000
No...  No!

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:25.840
Memories that don't disappear
And memories that disappeared

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:32.540
I quietly "NOW LOADING..." those scenes

00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:36.040
Memories left behind  Erased memories

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:39.180
What was the PASSWORD again?

00:22:39.610 --> 00:22:43.780
ACCESS records  Restored memories

00:22:44.050 --> 00:22:46.750
Challenge "the you inside you"

00:22:51.460 --> 00:22:57.630
You're a Network  The 
World that spreads beyond

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:00.770
With repeating "nows"

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:04.710
What about you?  "Live for now"

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:10.660
Grab the Shooting Star in 
the sky with both your hands

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:13.950
Overcome "now" with all your might  Yell!

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:39.060
Blood Shepherd is unfair.

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:42.430
He'll do anything to fulfill his goal.

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:47.740
Even if it means stomping 
all over someone's soul.

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:54.380
With his weakness taken advantage of, 
can Soulburner overcome this dilemma?

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:58.380
I found your weakness.

00:23:58.380 --> 00:24:02.460
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
The Ominous Ghost

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:04.660
Into the VRAINS!
